{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1628","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Peculiar Movie Preferences"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Mihai plans to watch a movie. He only likes palindromic movies, so he wants to skip some (possibly zero) scenes to make the remaining parts of the movie palindromic."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a list $$$s$$$ of $$$n$$$ non-empty strings of length "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"at most $$$3$$$"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", representing the scenes of Mihai's movie."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A subsequence of $$$s$$$ is called "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"awesome"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if it is non-empty and the concatenation of the strings in the subsequence, in order, is a palindrome."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Can you help Mihai check if there is at least one awesome subsequence of $$$s$$$?"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A palindrome is a string that reads the same backward as forward, for example strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aaa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abccba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are palindromes, but strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"codeforces"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"reality"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ab"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are not."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A sequence $$$a$$$ is a non-empty subsequence of a non-empty sequence $$$b$$$ if $$$a$$$ can be obtained from $$$b$$$ by deletion of several (possibly zero, but not all) elements."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 100$$$) — the number of test cases. The description of test cases follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 10^5$$$) — the number of scenes in the movie."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then follows $$$n$$$ lines, the $$$i$$$-th of which containing a single non-empty string $$$s_i$$$ of length at most $$$3$$$, consisting of lowercase Latin letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if there is an awesome subsequence of $$$s$$$, or \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" otherwise (case insensitive)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n5\nzx\nab\ncc\nzx\nba\n2\nab\nbad\n4\nco\ndef\norc\nes\n3\na\nb\nc\n3\nab\ncd\ncba\n2\nab\nab\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\nNO\nNO\nYES\nYES\nNO\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, an awesome subsequence of $$$s$$$ is $$$[ab, cc, ba]$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"1628B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1628/problem/B"}